 "name_en": "Make-to-Order Production with Variant Configuration (1YT)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Make-to-Order Production with Variant Configuration (1YT)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioea81cb9289e440879fc39c0308d36ea1\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioea81cb9289e440879fc39c0308d36ea1__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item shows a Make-to-Order Production scenario using the Advanced Variant Configuration for an efficient state-of-the-art configuration of a material ordered by a customer, covering single-level and multi-level configurable materials. The configurable material is defined as a bill of material. In this process, a sales order (optionally based on a sales quotation) is created with an individual configuration for a fork lifter. This is captured by defining the different component characteristics desired by the customers and considering the constraints and dependencies of the components. The sales price calculation is then based on the individually chosen characteristics of the components. The sales order is considered for production planning when doing the Materials Requirements Planning (MRP). The production execution for the individual fork lifter takes place before delivering it to the customer. The process finishes with the billing to the customer.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioea81cb9289e440879fc39c0308d36ea1__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create a customer sales order (optionally based on a sales quotation) for an individually configured fork lifter either single-level or multi-level</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Calculate sales prices based on the customer chosen characteristics of the configurable product</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Execute the Make-to-Order production of the fork lifter ordered by the customer with routings according to the configuration</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Process the delivery and billing for the customer</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioea81cb9289e440879fc39c0308d36ea1__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Improve your company's sales and manufacturing performance with integrated Advanced Variant Configuration covering single-level and multi-level configurable materials</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Enable your business processes to handle highly individualized products in sales and manufacturing</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Leverage the sophisticated algorithms in the performance-optimized rules engine within a state-of-the-art configurator</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Use dependencies to prevent combinations of options that are not allowed and can be used to select exactly the right components</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Get sales pricing and print-out according to the configuration</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>含变式配置的按订单生产 (1YT)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioea81cb9289e440879fc39c0308d36ea1\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioea81cb9289e440879fc39c0308d36ea1__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目显示使用高级变式配置的按订单生产场景，该场景用于客户订购的物料的最先进的有效配置，涵盖单级和多级可配置物料。可配置物料定义为物料清单。在此流程中，使用叉车的单独配置创建销售订单（基于销售报价）。这可以通过定义客户所需的不同组件特征，并考虑组件的约束和相关性来捕获。然后，根据单独选择的组件特征计算销售价格。在进行物料需求计划 (MRP) 时，生产计划会考虑销售订单。单个升降式叉车的生产执行在交付给客户之前进行。该流程以向客户开票结束。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioea81cb9289e440879fc39c0308d36ea1__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">为单独配置的升降式叉车创建客户销售订单（可以基于销售报价），无论是单级还是多级</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">根据客户选择的可配置产品特征，计算销售价格</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">根据配置，使用工艺路线为客户订购的叉车执行按订单生产</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">处理交货并为客户开票</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioea81cb9289e440879fc39c0308d36ea1__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">通过涵盖单级和多级可配置物料的集成式高级变式配置，提高公司的销售和制造绩效</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">支持业务流程在销售和制造中处理高度个性化的产品。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">在最先进的配置器中，利用性能优化规则引擎中的复杂算法</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">使用相关性防止不允许的选项组合，可用于准确选择正确的组件</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">根据配置获取销售定价和打印件</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
